  "description": "Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection integration for PostQuantum.FileEncryption. Adds AddPqFileEncryption() and AddPqHybridFileEncryption() extension methods that register PqFileEncryptor/PqFileDecryptor and PqHybridEncryptor/PqHybridDecryptor as singletons, with optional PqEncryptionOptions. Brings the core library (authenticated AES-256-GCM over the FROZEN .pqfe v2 container, PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 or Argon2id) and the production X25519 + ML-KEM-768 hybrid package into any host using the standard .NET service container — ASP.NET Core, Worker Services, console hosts. Public API surface locked by Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.PublicApiAnalyzers; CycloneDX SBOM and SLSA-style build-provenance attestation on every release.",
