  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 — first published release of the dependency-injection extensions, packaged from the same source tree, release workflow, and supply-chain pipeline as PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.1.0 and tracking it in lockstep. The .pqfe v2 container format is FROZEN for the 1.x line.",
